---
// Schedule.astro - Redesigned based on fuckfuck.html with Orange theme
---

<section class="section schedule" id="schedule">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">05 / Timetable</p>
        <h2>週間スケジュール</h2>
      </div>
      <span class="section-index" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
    </div>

    <div class="legend">
      <span><i style="--dot:#1e4bb0"></i>オールレベル</span>
      <span><i style="--dot:#0e6e4a"></i>ビギナー</span>
      <span><i style="--dot:#a14309"></i>キッズ</span>
      <span><i style="--dot:#693299"></i>NOGI (道着なし)</span>
    </div>

    <p class="scroll-notice">← 横にスクロールしてご覧いただけます →</p>

    <div class="schedule-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="週間スケジュール。横スクロールできます">
      <table class="timetable" aria-label="週間クラススケジュール">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">月 (MON)</th>
            <th scope="col">火 (TUE)</th>
            <th scope="col">水 (WED)</th>
            <th scope="col">木 (THU)</th>
            <th scope="col">金 (FRI)</th>
            <th scope="col">土 (SAT)</th>
            <th scope="col">日 (SUN)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>
              <div class="session all">
                <strong>オールレベル</strong>
                <time>10:00-11:30</time>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td class="closed" rowspan="4">休館日</td>
            <td>
              <div class="session all">
                <strong>オールレベル</strong>
                <time>10:00-11:30</time>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td class="closed" rowspan="4">休館日</td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td></td>
            <td>
              <div class="session beginner">
                <strong>ビギナー柔術</strong>
                <time>18:00-19:00</time>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td></td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td>
              <div class="session kids">
                <strong>キッズ柔術</strong>
                <time>19:00-20:00</time>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td>
              <div class="session beginner">
                <strong>ビギナー柔術</strong>
                <time>19:00-20:00</time>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td>
              <div class="session beginner">
                <strong>ビギナー柔術</strong>
                <time>19:00-20:00</time>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td>
              <div class="session kids">
                <strong>キッズ柔術</strong>
                <time>19:00-20:00</time>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td>
              <div class="session kids">
                <strong>キッズ柔術</strong>
                <time>19:00-20:00</time>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td>
              <div class="session all">
                <strong>オールレベル</strong>
                <time>20:30-22:00</time>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td>
              <div class="session all">
                <strong>オールレベル</strong>
                <time>20:30-22:00</time>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td>
              <div class="session nogi">
                <strong>NOGI</strong>
                <time>20:30-22:00</time>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td>
              <div class="session all">
                <strong>オールレベル</strong>
                <time>20:30-22:00</time>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td>
              <div class="session all">
                <strong>オールレベル</strong>
                <time>20:30-22:00</time>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="schedule-note">
      ※ 祝日や試合等により変更となる場合がございます。最新の休館情報は
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/tshr_jiujitsu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
      をご確認ください。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .schedule {
    padding-block: 108px;
    background: #f4f4ee;
    color: #141613;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
  }

  .wrap {
    width: min(1220px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #ff6b00;
  }

  .eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    background: currentColor;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .section-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #141613;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .section-head h2 {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.8vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .section-index {
    color: #a2a799;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.85;
  }

  .legend {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .legend span {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .legend i {
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--dot);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .scroll-notice {
    display: none;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #666a61;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .schedule-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid #141613;
    background: #fff;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }

  .timetable {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 900px;
    table-layout: fixed;
  }

  .timetable th {
    padding: 14px 8px;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    background: #141613;
    color: #f4f4ee;
    border-right: 1px solid #333;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .timetable td {
    padding: 8px;
    height: 100px;
    vertical-align: top;
    border-right: 1px solid #eaede2;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eaede2;
  }

  .timetable td.closed {
    background: #f7f8f4;
    color: #a4a89d;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .session {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--tone);
    padding: 10px 8px;
    background: var(--tint);
    min-height: 78px;
  }

  .session strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--tone);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .session time {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #141613;
  }

  .all {
    --tone: #1e4bb0;
    --tint: #eef3ff;
  }

  .beginner {
    --tone: #0e6e4a;
    --tint: #edf7f1;
  }

  .kids {
    --tone: #a14309;
    --tint: #fff2e8;
  }

  .nogi {
    --tone: #693299;
    --tint: #f5edfc;
  }

  .schedule-note {
    color: #666a61;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-top: 18px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .schedule-note a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .schedule-note a:hover {
    color: #ff6b00;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .schedule {
      padding-block: 72px;
    }
    .wrap {
      width: calc(100% - 32px);
    }
    .scroll-notice {
      display: block;
    }
  }
</style>
